  <element>
    <id>UMLNote</id>
    <coordinates><x>0</x><y>920</y><w>1280</w><h>70</h></coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>No foreign key crosses a service boundary; batch_id, sku and agent_trace_id in another service's table are plain values copied from events. FR12/FR13 read models are Kafka Streams state
stores (velocity-windows, velocity-baselines, batch-states, batch-risks), not tables. Monetary columns are DECIMAL(19,4); Money normalises to scale 2 on the way out (spec-03 s7).
bg=#FFFBE6</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>
